# SmartPeti AI Builder

A modern, mobile-first AI-powered platform to generate websites, apps, games, eBooks, and more from simple text prompts.

## Features
- AI Chat Assistant with conversation history
- App, Website, eBook, and Game builders
- Multi-language (English, Bengali, Hindi)
- Dark / Light mode
- User auth & project management
- Multiple AI providers (OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, DeepSeek, Grok)

## Tech Stack
- React 18
- React Router v6
- Tailwind CSS
- Context API
- LocalStorage (MVP)

